---
layout: base.njk
title: Save something
permalink: /save/
noindex: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
scripts: ["/assets/save.js"]
---
{#- Owner tool. The site is static, so saving opens GitHub's "new file" page
    with the Markdown already filled in. Commit it and the next build has it. -#}
<div class="page-wrap wa-stack wa-gap-2xl" data-save data-repo="{{ site.repo }}" data-branch="{{ site.branch }}">
  <header class="wa-stack wa-gap-s">
    <h1>Save something</h1>
    <p class="lead">A link or a thought. No shelf, tags or title needed. It lands in the inbox and stays private until you publish it.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="save-cols">
    <form class="save-form wa-stack wa-gap-l" data-save-form>
      <wa-input name="input" label="Link or note" placeholder="Paste a link, or type a thought…" required autofocus></wa-input>
      <wa-textarea name="note" label="Say something about it" hint="Optional. Why you kept it, in a line." rows="3" resize="auto"></wa-textarea>
      <div class="wa-cluster wa-gap-m">
        <wa-button type="submit" variant="brand">
          <wa-icon slot="start" name="github" family="brands"></wa-icon>
          Save to the repo
        </wa-button>
        <span class="caption">or press <kbd>⌘</kbd> <kbd>↵</kbd></span>
      </div>
    </form>

    <section class="save-preview wa-stack wa-gap-s" aria-labelledby="preview-heading">
      <div class="wa-split">
        <h2 id="preview-heading" class="side-heading">What gets written</h2>
        <wa-copy-button data-copy from="save-file" copy-label="Copy Markdown"></wa-copy-button>
      </div>
      <code class="file-path" data-path>src/content/…</code>
      <pre class="file-preview"><code id="save-file" data-file>---
status: inbox
---</code></pre>
      <p class="caption">One Markdown file. <code>status: inbox</code> means the build skips it.</p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="wa-stack wa-gap-m" aria-labelledby="ways-heading">
    <h2 id="ways-heading">Ways in</h2>
    <div class="wa-grid wa-gap-l ways">
      <wa-card>
        <div class="wa-stack wa-gap-xs">
          <h3 class="way-title"><wa-icon name="bookmark"></wa-icon> Bookmarklet</h3>
          <p>Drag this to your bookmarks bar. On any page, click it to open this form with the page's address, title and thumbnail image filled in.</p>
          <p><a class="bookmarklet" data-bookmarklet href="#">Save to earlmade</a></p>
        </div>
      </wa-card>
      <wa-card>
        <div class="wa-stack wa-gap-xs">
          <h3 class="way-title"><wa-icon name="mobile-screen"></wa-icon> Share sheet</h3>
          <p>Make an iOS Shortcut that opens <code>/save/?url=</code> plus the shared URL. It then shows up when you tap Share in Safari, Music or Books.</p>
        </div>
      </wa-card>
      <wa-card>
        <div class="wa-stack wa-gap-xs">
          <h3 class="way-title"><wa-icon name="terminal"></wa-icon> Command line</h3>
          <p>From the repo: <code>npm run save -- https://example.com "why I kept it"</code>. It writes the file and warns about duplicates.</p>
        </div>
      </wa-card>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
